ascension, but I find it's more fun to speed up the game by filling
in my ascension kit using poly and wishing.  L's, h's and ;'s don't
particularly bother me, so I don't genocide them, but I would if
I found them sufficiently annoying without a single qualm.  And,
I love the eyes of the overworld, so I always blow as many wishes
as I need to, first change I get, to wish for those.  Does that make
the game easier?  Of course.  Is it cheating?  Who cares?  It's
solitaire.

But, I have a great deal of respect for people who manage to pull
off illiterate and/or foodless and/or athiest and/or naked ascensions.
